    description: "WHAT (seen 2026-11-18). A change holding a NEW tracker ops file (.agent/tracker-workspace/.ops/.WI-x.ops, written by any tracker add) makes coverage-select graph-select exit 5: 'was added since the stored graph and no other changed file mentions it'; smart-test then runs a fresh analysis (331 s of a 514 s run). A fresh analysis gives tracker data no node either (the newest stored graph, 29, holds 0 paths under .agent/tracker*), so it answers nothing the stored graph could not. FIX. graph_select.judge_added: an added file under .agent/tracker/ or .agent/tracker-workspace/ needs no analysis. CLOSE CONDITION. A unit test, and a live smart-test run with a pending new .ops file that selects from the stored graph."  # 008c
