  message: "Merged as PR #2261. Root cause: graph_select.judge_added sent an added tracker op file to 'needs analysis' (nothing mentions it), though no analysis gives tracker data a node (stored graph 29: 0 paths under .agent/tracker*). Fix: tracker data is set aside (AddedFiles.tracker_data); unit test test_added_tracker_data_needs_no_analysis. Live, dev 3852addf6: 'coverage-select graph-select --changed-files <new untracked .agent/tracker-workspace/.ops/.WI-kihah...ops + graph_select.py> --build dfca1edd8196f6bb' -> exit 0, 'stored graph 30 of 61b03763f ... 4 file(s) named'; before the fix the same shape exited 5 ('was added since the stored graph and no other changed file mentions it') and the run analysed for 331 s."  # 8560
